      "title": "Bilal",
      "intro": "Known for: First mu'adhdhin of Islam.",
      "explanationContent": "Known for: First mu'adhdhin of Islam. Full name: Bilal ibn Rabah al-Habashi. Father: Rabah. Born in Makkah. Passed away in 20 AH / 640 CE at Damascus.\nHis master name Ubay ibn Khalaf\nHe was a elite next to Abu jahil\nThis is like living next your boss and Bilal didn't care he's Muslim and hes like the first to marry without music the black sheep of the family.\nHis father name\nThe prophet said they both starved for 30 days\nWhen you go from mecca\n1. No trive ni wealth no freedom\n2. 10 years younger than the prophet\n3. U may. Ibn kaalaf was his master\n4. Mecca slave were treated like shit\n5. Tortured\n1. Ummaya said to put a stone 🪨 on his chest and he kept saying ahad over and over which is one\n2. Never asked for help just let people see his whipping\n6. Aby bakr heard of the torture\n1. And bought him\n2. Bought him if he could 109xnmoten\n7. Ge fought in bad and fought against his master\n8. Can you endure the oneness?\n9. Gave the adtha\n1. The true symbol of Islam The oppressed now lead the call. The slave now summon the free.\n10. The day the prophet died\n1. Bilal voice broke when the prophet died because they asked him to.donthe adtha. He got to the Muhammad part and he froze up he couldn't keep going started to cry and everyone around him cried\n2. He stopped doing the adthan and went to Syria to help the Muslims there\n11. On visit to Medina he was given the opportunity to give the adthan and when he did people thought the prophet was back\n12. Then went back to Syria for his final days\n1. The day before his death he said tomorrow he's going to die and meet Muhammad ﷺ\n13. He was given order to handle the fiances of the muslim\n- The prophet said he heard Bilal footsteps in jannah\nHadith Sahih al-Bukhari 1149\n1. Bilal footsteps are heard in jannah\n1. First abysidian/Ethiopian to accept Islam\n2. First slave to accept Islam\n3. First 7 to say the shahara in public\n1. He's not ashamed of his belief the opposite of the boy who doesn't pray cause he doesn't want to be different from his classmates\n1. Looks don't matter\n1. 91% of teenag re in the US is self conscious about their looks\n2. He was black like Adam and Musa but was treated like the bottom of the barrel\n3. He was hunched over skinny and Harry\n2. Lineage doesn't matter\n1. His father was a slave\n3. The first to do something\n1. We have families that loves the first doctor the first engineer the lawyer but not for the Hafiz\n2. The first person to put the hijab or the niquab to be different for the right reason\n4. A Muslim is gold\n1. How much of your faith are you strong in the emmesne of torture\n5. Learn to make friends",
