      "explanationContent": "Known for: Youngest daughter of the Prophet ﷺ; leader of the women of Paradise. Full name: Fatimah bint Muhammad. Tribe: Quraysh, clan of Banu Hashim. Father: Muhammad ﷺ. Born in Makkah. Passed away in 11 AH / 632 CE at Madinah.\nAli's mother name is Fatima\nThe name Fatima means\nYoungest daughter — leader of women of Jannah\n- Died: 632 CE (6 months after the Prophet ﷺ)\n- Cause: Illness + grief\n- Burial: Jannat al-Baqī‘, Madinah (exact grave unmarked by her request)\n- Mother of Hasan, Husayn, and Zaynab\n- The purest woman of this Ummah\n- She resembled the Prophet ﷺ more than anyone\n- Ultimate example of modesty, faith, and strength.",
