      "title": "Khabbaab Ibn Al-Arat",
      "intro": "Known for: One of the earliest converts; enslaved swordsmith tortured for Islam.",
      "explanationContent": "Known for: One of the earliest converts; enslaved swordsmith tortured for Islam. Full name: Khabbab ibn al-Aratt. Passed away at Kufa.\nBorn:\nDied:\nAh 37\n1. He was a sword maker for Makkah\n2. He never left his house or work\n3. He was the slave of Umm 'Ammaar and the main person that tortued him.\n1. She placed buring iron on his head. He was so dicipline that he didn't want to give his torturer joy by not even moaning.\n2. One day the prophet saw the burnt on his head and couldn't do anything but raised his hands and made dua that khabbaab to be victorious against the disbeling people.\n1. A few days later Umm ammar got\n4. One of the first pioneer of Islam\n5. He was tortured by the polytheists by putting buring sones on his naked back until flesh came off - narrated by Ash-sha'biy\n6. Other tortures was that they went to his shop took all the iron from his swords smelted it and chained him up with those irons.\n7. He would teach Quran to his brother\n1. 'Abd Allah Ibn Mas'uud said He considered Khabbaab as a reference to all concers of Quran and whether as as text or textbook.\n2. He taught Quran to Faatimah Bint Al-Khattab and Sa'iid ibn Zaid this is when Umar ibn al-Khattab barged in before he became muslim with his sword.\n8. Duringt he calipates time of Umar and uthmaan the Muslim Treasury Bait Al-Maal overfload with money and gave khabbaab a large salary. espeicallly cause he witnessed all the battles and wars sisde by side wit the prohet.\n1. He built a house in Kufa\n9. His brother visted his death bed\n1. He creid not because of dieing but his brother remined of his brothers of islam who left this life wihout enjoying any luxery to this deen.\n2. He mentioned the shroud of Hamzah\nThe quraish came to his house to get the finished swords and came late and they were kinda shocked cause he never leaves his house and he comes in drunk of joy saying have you seen the prophet. They were getting mad of course and he was quesstioning should he annoucne his islam there or in public.\nThink of it like this he was so in this spritiual ecstasy that it's alike a revert finally realized the truth and broke the matrix.\nThen he went uncuncious after saying the shahada in front of those in his store.\nhe woke up seeing that the clients left and his body full ofbleeding bruises and wounds.\nWhat you can learn form him\n1. Islam wasn't a just a religion, it was the annoucement of glad tidings of emergence of the weak and the oppressed people who would stand up as one man under the standard of islam and would stand on equal terms with those who used and abused them in the past.\n2. Him and a group of those that were tortued went to the prophet and asked when will Allah give them safety and victory and the prophet said those before them had it worse and they trusted in Allah more then yall. but you have no pateince.\n1. the group got strong determination in patience, will and self sacrafice.\n3. The quraish fought faith with torture while the believers fought torture with self sacrafice",
      "keyTakeaway": "Khabbaab Ibn Al-Arat: One of the earliest converts; enslaved swordsmith tortured for Islam.",
