      "explanationContent": "Known for: Mother of the Prophet's son Ibrahim; sent by al-Muqawqis of Egypt. Full name: Mariya bint Sham'un al-Qibtiyya. Father: Sham'un. Born in Egypt. Passed away in 16 AH / 637 CE at Madinah.\n(Not counted among wives, but mother of the Prophet's son)\n- Born: ~620 CE\n- Died: 637 CE\n- Age: ~17 when gifted, ~37 at death\n- Cause: Illness\n- Father: Shamon\n- Mother: Qibtiyyah (Coptic lineage)\n- Mother of Ibrāhīm (RA)\n- Honored like a wife\n- Gift from Egyptian ruler Muqawqis\n- Alliance-building\n- She accepted Islam and was honored greatly\n- Allah elevates anyone who enters Islam sincerely\ndied 5 years after the prophet died",
