      "explanationContent": "Known for: Final Messenger of Allah. Full name: Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Muttalib. Tribe: Quraysh, clan of Banu Hashim. Father: Abdullah ibn Abd al-Muttalib. Born in Makkah. Passed away in 12 Rabi al-Awwal 11 AH / 8 June 632 CE at Madinah.\n- Known for: Final Messenger of Allah\n- Born: c. 570 CE, Makkah\n- Died: 632 CE / 11 AH, Madinah\n- Title: Prophet and Messenger\n- Revelation: First Revelation\n- Hijrah: Hijrah to Madinah\n- Family: Mothers of the Believers · Prophet Family\n- Buried: Madinah\nThe Prophesies that Muhammed Predicted\nAl mahi the one who gets rid of kuffar\nAhmed is the name of the people who were great support of Jesus\nThe coming of the prophet Muhammad is the first sign of the day of judgment (al hesham)\nHe will be the first person resurrected\nAl hesher the one who signals the day of judgment\nHe is the leader of all of humanity he is the sayid\n[!note]\n✅\nSending Salawat to Muhammad:\n- Short\nSallallāhu 'alayhi wa sallam\n\"May Allah send His peace and blessings upon him.\"\n✅ Use this every time you hear or say Muhammad ﷺ.\n✅ The Prophet ﷺ said:\n\"Whoever sends blessings upon me once, Allah will send blessings upon him ten times.\"\n(Sahih Muslim, 408)\n- Mid\nSallallāhu 'alayhi wa 'alā ālihi wa aṣhābihi wa sallam\n\"May Allah send His peace and blessings upon him, his family, and his companions.\"\n✅ Use when:\n- Mentioning the Prophet ﷺ in speeches or lectures.\n- After du'ā or dhikr.\n- To show extra love and respect by including his family and companions.\n🕊 Reward:\nYou still receive 10 blessings for each time you say it — and it's more beloved to Allah because it includes the Prophet's closest people.\n- Long\nAllahumma salli 'ala Sayyidina Muhammadin wa 'ala āli Sayyidina Muhammad wa 'ala as'habi Sayyidina Muhammad wa sallim\n\"O Allah, send Your blessings upon our master Muhammad, upon the family of our master Muhammad, and upon the companions of our master Muhammad, and grant them peace.\"\n✅ Includes the Prophet ﷺ, his family, and his companions — showing complete love and respect.\n✅ Commonly used by imams, scholars, and Sufis in gatherings or after dhikr.\n1. They had idols\n1. Prayed towards rocks and whatever because mom and dad did it\n2. They were obsessed with status like how out south Asian parents are lol\n3. They don't go directly to the creator they talk to a middle man which is a rock\n4. If they see a bigger rock they go for that one they follow the TREND\n2. They ate decaying flesh\n1. They didn't care about their health\n3. Women lose shit\n1. They get married off to their son after their spouse died\n2. They will lose all their properties\n3. They had open door policy the red flag 🚩\n4. She gets pregnant and hires a face recognizer to find the husband p\nThings that were obligatory on the prophet\nEvidence of Prophet-hood\n1. When he would give talks and lectures he will tell everyone to get closer especially the young people.\nThe only prophet that has been sent for all of humanity and jinn\nThe The profit saw a Uma that was larger than he's ever seen and he asked this is his but it isn't is it's mousas and then when he asked to see his own he couldn't even see the horizon that's how much how many Muslims there is\nJannah is like the higher you go up the less people\nThere's gonna be a floor on top of Firdaws and below the throne of Allah and only one person can be there\nOur prophet is the most beautiful\n1. They use to.colledt the prophet sweat when he slept and use it as fragrance or medicine\n2. He would always walk fast like if the world is on a slope\n3. When he would talk to someone he would always turn his body towards them and never talk with his behind having them\nThe Prophet's Sleep Schedule\nThe Prophets Last Words on his Deathbed",
