      "explanationContent": "Known for: Messenger sent to Thamud; the she-camel of Allah. Tribe: Thamud.\n- The miracle of the She camel\n1. Saleh was arab like hud and Muhammed\n2. The people of thamud were the next superpower they had lots of resources like gardens fruits dates and wste. Al hijga is located between medina and tabook.\n1. 9th yeear of hijra he passed this and it's called the sight of Saleh\n2. What the sahabi did when they saw well there they filled their jugs and cooked food with it. Also for the cattle and when the prophet saw this he said throw away everything that you cooked your water with\n3. Remember they are travelers so they're limited to water and now they're being told to throw it\n4. The prophet said when u go past a city that was punished by Allah go through their punishment because u may face what they face\n1. The prophet said don't go here for tourism.\n2. Theirs only one well u can drink from here...\n3. Allah gave them security but they didn't appreciate it he said they are liars and corruptors and disbelievers\nSunan Ibn Majah 59 - A atoms weight of arrogance won't take you to jannah\n1.Allah send them a prophet 11:61\n1. What he addressed first was to pray to Allah\n2. He reminds them of their blessings\n3. The weak people and poor are the most followers and this is the same as Muhammed\n1. The poor needs hope they are oppressed and someone notices them as human instead of cattle\n4.",
