      "title": "Khadijah bint khuwaylid",
      "intro": "Known for: First wife of the Prophet ﷺ and the first to believe in him.",
      "explanationContent": "Known for: First wife of the Prophet ﷺ and the first to believe in him. Full name: Khadijah bint Khuwaylid. Tribe: Quraysh, clan of Banu Asad ibn Abd al-Uzza. Father: Khuwaylid ibn Asad. Born in Makkah. Passed away in 10 Ramadan, 3 years before Hijrah / 619 CE at Makkah.\n1. The name Khadijah means pre mature so when a baby comes out early they name the women Khadijah.\n2. Leader of all the women of the time was her title\n3. First believer of Islam to Muhammad (SAW) ﷺ\n- Khadijah was 25-28 years old not 40 when she married the Prophet.\nReal Age Of Khadija R.A When She Married Prophet Muhammad PBUH? Not 40 - Sheikh Uthman Ibn Farooq\nFirst Wife — Mother of the Believers\n- Born: 555 CE\n- Died: 619 CE\n- Age at death: ~64\n- Cause of death: Natural illness after the Boycott of Quraysh\n- Father: Khuwaylid ibn Asad\n- Mother: Fāṭimah bint Zā'idah\n- Status: Widow before marrying the Prophet ﷺ\n- First person to ever accept Islam\n- The Prophet's greatest supporter\n- Gave all her wealth to Islam\n- Mother of Fāṭimah (RA)\n- Comforted him during the first revelation\n- Perfect woman of Jannah (Sahih Bukhari)\n- Mutual respect\n- She admired his honesty and character\n- Allah destined her to support early Islam\n- Loyalty in marriage\n- Supporting your husband emotionally and financially\n- Having full trust in Allah during hardship\n- First believer of Islam to Muhammed (SAW) ﷺ",
