      "explanationContent": "Known for: “Mother of the Poor”; wife of the Prophet ﷺ who died within months of the marriage. Full name: Zaynab bint Khuzayma ibn al-Harith ibn Abd Allah ibn Amr ibn Abd Manaf ibn Hilal ibn Amir ibn Sa'sa'a al-Hilaliyya al-Amiriyya. Father: Khuzayma ibn al-Harith. Born in Makkah. Passed away in Rabi al-Thani 4 AH / 625 CE at Madinah.\nFifth Wife — \"Mother of the Poor\"\n- Born: ~595 CE\n- Died: 626 CE\n- Age: ~31\n- Cause: Illness\n- Father: Khuzaymah ibn al-Hārith\n- Mother: Hind bint 'Awf\n- Status: Widow\n- Known as Umm al-Masākīn for her charity\n- Fed the poor constantly\n- Died only 8 months after marriage\n- To support a woman famous for helping the poor\n- Charity elevates you to the highest ranks of believers",
